\par In this window you specify the font type and size, the style and colour of the characters you are going to use in the text cells.
\par 
\par It is advisable to use the basic Windows fonts, preferably }{\i\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 TrueType}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057  ones. It is not recommended to use the printer's fonts, since they may take on a different appeara
nce on computers which don\rquote t have them installed.
\par 
\par If the font size chosen is too big, some of the texts may not fit in their cells. The programme will then reduce them to fit. The reduction of font size will affect all cells in the grid affected by this problem.
\par 
\par As for colours, you may choose different ones for the }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 text}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 , }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 background }{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 and }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
shade}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 . The colour you have specified for the shade will also be used to represent the text in the solved cells in associations giving }{\uldb\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 solutions to grid A}{
\v\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 H_A_SOLA}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 .
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f1\fs20\lang1027\langfe3082\cgrid\langnp1027\langfenp3082 {\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
