\par 
\par There are four different areas in text activities: }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Main text, Text in cells, Help windows }{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 and }{\b\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 Message box}{\lang2057\langfe3082\langnp2057 
